          {
            "label": "Smart Motion & Privacy",
            "sections": [
              {
                "heading": "Detection that respects the mask",
                "accent": "violet",
                "text": [
                  "Motion detection is a pipeline, and privacy is enforced at its first stage. The PIR sensor wakes Sentry on a heat change; Vision grabs one low-resolution analysis frame; zones are applied on the sensor before anything else sees pixels.",
                  "A person in an armed zone becomes an alert. Motion in a masked zone is dropped on-device — those pixels are cropped out before the frame reaches the classifier, so they never exist off the sensor."
                ],
                "bullets": [
                  "Privacy masks are applied on-sensor: masked pixels never leave the device",
                  "The classifier distinguishes person / package / vehicle / animal",
                  "Analysis frames are 320×240 luma-only — full video starts only for real events",
                  "Zone edits in the app take effect on the next wake, no reboot"
                ],
                "diagram": {
                  "view": "ambient",
                  "nodes": {
                    "pir": { "title": "PIR Sensor", "sub": "passive infrared", "icon": "thermo", "tint": "dev" },
                    "sentry": { "title": "Sentry LP", "sub": "wake logic", "icon": "chip", "tint": "dev" },
                    "vision": { "title": "Vision HP", "sub": "frame + classifier", "icon": "chip", "tint": "dev" },
                    "zones": { "title": "Zone Policy", "sub": "masks + armed areas", "icon": "shield", "tint": "auth" },
                    "pulse": { "title": "Pulse Events", "sub": "event decision", "icon": "server", "tint": "cmd" },
                    "phone": { "title": "Owner's Phone", "sub": "rich alert", "icon": "phone", "tint": "dev" }
                  },
                  "rows": [
                    ["pir", "sentry", "vision", "zones"],
                    ["pulse", "phone"]
                  ],
                  "edges": [
                    { "from": "pir", "to": "sentry", "kind": "device", "label": "heat-delta IRQ" },
                    { "from": "sentry", "to": "vision", "kind": "device", "label": "wake + frame request" },
                    { "from": "vision", "to": "zones", "kind": "frame", "label": "low-res luma frame" },
                    { "from": "zones", "to": "pulse", "kind": "int", "label": "verdict: person, armed" },
                    { "from": "pulse", "to": "phone", "kind": "https", "label": "alert + snapshot" }
