            "label": "Day-One Setup",
            "sections": [
              {
                "heading": "From box to claimed in seven steps",
                "accent": "cyan",
                "source": "https://github.com/doorbuzz-hw/firmware/blob/main/provisioning/ble_pair.c#L118",
                "text": [
                  "Provisioning runs over BLE only long enough to hand the doorbell its WiFi credentials, encrypted under a key derived from the QR code in the box. After that the doorbell is a normal Cumulus device: it enrolls a per-device certificate, binds to the owner's account, and opens its permanent MQTT session.",
                  "This board opens in the guided view because setup is the flow where step order is the whole story."
                ],
                "bullets": [
                  "BLE never carries video or network traffic — pairing and credentials only",
                  "WiFi credentials cross encrypted under the QR-derived key, not plaintext",
                  "Each device gets its own X.509 certificate at enrollment; there are no shared secrets",
                  "Total time on a normal network: under 90 seconds"
                ],
                "diagram": {
                  "view": "step",
                  "nodes": {
                    "phone": { "title": "Owner's Phone", "sub": "setup app", "icon": "phone", "tint": "dev" },
                    "doorbell": { "title": "Lookout Doorbell", "sub": "Sentry LP", "icon": "chip", "tint": "dev", "link": "https://github.com/doorbuzz-hw/firmware/blob/main/provisioning/ble_pair.c#L118" },
                    "router": { "title": "Home WiFi", "sub": "WPA2 join", "icon": "router", "tint": "data" },
                    "sentinel": { "title": "Sentinel Auth", "sub": "cert enrollment", "icon": "shield", "tint": "auth" },
                    "registry": { "title": "Registry", "sub": "account binding", "icon": "db", "tint": "data" },
                    "relay": { "title": "Relay", "sub": "MQTT · TLS :8883", "icon": "antenna", "tint": "mqtt" }
                  },
                  "rows": [
                    ["phone", "doorbell", "router"],
                    ["sentinel", "registry", "relay"]
                  ],
                  "edges": [
                    { "from": "phone", "to": "doorbell", "kind": "ble", "label": "pair · QR-derived key" },
                    { "from": "doorbell", "to": "router", "kind": "int", "label": "join WLAN" },
                    { "from": "doorbell", "to": "sentinel", "kind": "https", "label": "enroll: per-device cert" },
                    { "from": "sentinel", "to": "registry", "kind": "int", "label": "bind to account" },
                    { "from": "registry", "to": "relay", "kind": "int", "label": "authorize session" },
                    { "from": "relay", "to": "doorbell", "kind": "mqtt", "label": "first connect" }
                  ],
                  "steps": [
                    { "edge": "phone->doorbell", "lane": "NET", "text": "The app finds the doorbell over BLE and pairs with the key from the box QR code — BLE never carries video or WiFi traffic." },
                    { "edge": "phone->doorbell", "lane": "NET", "text": "WiFi credentials cross the BLE link encrypted under the QR-derived key." },
                    { "edge": "doorbell->router", "lane": "NET", "text": "The doorbell joins the home network and shuts BLE down." },
                    { "edge": "doorbell->sentinel", "lane": "NET", "text": "It enrolls with Sentinel: CSR up, per-device X.509 certificate back." },
                    { "edge": "sentinel->registry", "lane": "NET", "text": "The certificate binds this exact hardware to the owner's account." },
                    { "edge": "registry->relay", "lane": "NET", "text": "Registry authorizes the device's MQTT session with Relay." },
                    { "edge": "relay->doorbell", "lane": "DEV", "text": "First connect succeeds — the ring LED goes solid. Claimed, in under 90 seconds." }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Power to Last a Year",
