                "text": [
                  "Battery life is a budget, and the two-chip design is the budget's whole trick: Sentry LP holds the network for 4 mW while Vision HP — thirty times hungrier per second — only exists during events.",
                  "This board shows the flows with real numbers. A dedicated power-flow visualization (animated source-to-load bands) is planned; the topology and the arithmetic are already accurate here."
