                  "Baseline: Sentry 4 mW around the clock ≈ 96 mWh/day",
                  "Each 30 s event costs ≈ 27 mWh (Vision boot + encode + radio burst)",
                  "Ten events/day with zero sun ≈ 34 days to empty; 4 h of decent sun/day ≈ indefinite",
                  "Cold weather derates the pack: at −10 °C plan on roughly 60% of rated capacity"
                ],
